# Terminal recording of scripts/demo.sh. Regenerate with: make build && vhs demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 620
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Theme "Builtin Dark"

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear" Enter
Show
Type "./scripts/demo.sh" Enter
Sleep 7s
